"value":1,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5214640","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3879550-1846651706683855","game_id":"steam-3879550","kind":"announcement","title":"Your favourite bookshop is coming to STEAM NEXT FEST!","summary":"Your favourite bookshop is coming to STEAM NEXT FEST! Join us in our journey to become the best bookshop in steamtown. Play the demo, tell us your thoughts and feedbacks.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T05:38:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706683855","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3879550-1846651706678939","game_id":"steam-3879550","kind":"update","title":"Update 1.0 is live!","summary":"We have eased a few dog-eared pages and made it slightly easy to learn how to operate your own bookshop.Tutorial updatesBug fixesWe loved your feedbacks and applied a few in this small update of My Bookshop Dreams Demo.Keep 'em coming and Keep reading folks!Join our discord to stay updated and don't forget to leave a review.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T18:37:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706678939","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3879550-1846651706674234","game_id":"steam-3879550","kind":"announcement","title":"My Bookshop Dreams Demo is Out Now!","summary":"My Bookshop Dreams Demo is Live!Book's out of the bag!Play as a new bookshop owner, and run your shop in a cozy town neighbourhood. Manage and customize your shop, help curious readers, stock shelves and participate in special events. Come and flip the pages with us in this limited access experience of My Bookshop Dreams.Join our Discord Share your thoughts, report bugs, and communicate with us about your feedbacks, features and any easter eggs you want to put in, we'd love to hear about it, in ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T13:01:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706674234","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3879550-1846018067940095","game_id":"steam-3879550","kind":"announcement","title":"My Bookshop Dreams Demo Launches on October 14","summary":"Hello Book Lovers!Hope you all are excited to play the My Bookshop Dreams Demo! Coming out on October 14th.In the demo, you will step into the shoes of a new bookshop owner and run your shop in a cozy town neighbourhood. Stock your shelves with a selection of books and genres, arrange your shop, and help curious readers find their next favourite story.Make the shop truly yours with furniture, décor items, wallpapers and floor designs. Along the way, you will also host two special events featurin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T06:10:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067940095","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3879550-1845383656380074","game_id":"steam-3879550","kind":"announcement","title":"My Bookshop Dreams Demo Launches on October 14","summary":"Hello Book Lovers 📚,We are excited to announce that the My Bookshop Dreams Demo will be available on October 14.In the demo, you will step into the shoes of a new bookshop owner and run your shop in a cozy town neighbourhood. Stock your shelves with a selection of books and genres, arrange your shop, and help curious readers find their next favourite story.Make the shop truly yours with furniture, décor items, wallpapers and floor designs. Along the way, you will also host two special events fea","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T06:54:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656380074","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3879550-1838407329259450","game_id":"steam-3879550","kind":"announcement","title":"2,000 Wishlists. THANK YOU!","summary":"We're very proud to share that our game has officially gained 2,400 wishlists.Thank you for your amazing support! For a small indie team, this pushes us to perfect ourselves and bring the demo as soon as possible.Development is going strong! Showcases across the nation gave us valuable feedback and amazing response! We are currently finishing the First Person camera mechanics, adding more customization items and new locations. New gameplay trailer and demo out soon.Thank you!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-17T12:59:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329259450","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3879550":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:01:45Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:01:45Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3879550":"2026-10-26T11:01:45Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3879550":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:01:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:01:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:01:45Z"},"5214640":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:01:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:01:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11